{"version":1,"content":"<p>【最好的嫁妝 😂】近日中國一場婚禮上，一名新娘為喜愛電腦硬體的新郎準備了一份意想不到的結婚大禮——一張美國政府限制進口中國的 GeForce RTX 5090 顯示卡，而且還要是最頂級的 ASUS ROG Astral。</p><p>當新郎在婚禮現場接過這份厚禮時，情緒激動得當場落淚。</p><p>目前這張顯示卡在中國的黑市價高達 12,000 美元（折合約 93,600 港元 / 384,000 新台幣）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T18:18:43.011454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:13:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:14.424867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:17:36.435517+00:00","content_hash":"3dbf2bf4bfd15a4d45190803aff22b20c4d74c6548e4d78629a1a24bf2696afe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}